From c32c495a48b6a833ee537c69d6b9cb766357d27e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] xboard-node v1.0.1 protocol compatibility integration

Apply this complete patch to the Xboard checkout at the documented upstream
commit. It wires the compatibility helper into the node payload and the
subscription pipeline; it is not a documentation-only helper.

diff --git a/app/Http/Controllers/V1/Client/ClientController.php b/app/Http/Controllers/V1/Client/ClientController.php
